Fixes found on a real phone.

Voice messages now arrive as voice messages instead of plain files. An
attachment you sent yourself can be opened and played again. The conversation's
name is back in its header. On Android 10 and 11 the microphone closes when
somebody calls you. And attachments can no longer be knocked out by a file left
in the queue by an older version.

Forwarding a message shows conversations with pictures and a search box.
